#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:2
msgid "Join and leave channels"
msgstr "채널 참여 및 나가기"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용 가능"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:8
msgid "Join a channel"
msgstr "채널 참여"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:10
msgid "Channels are either **public** or **private**."
msgstr "채널은 **공개** 또는 **비공개**\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Public** channels are identified with a **Globe** |globe| icon. Anyone "
"on the team can join a public channel."
msgstr ""
"**공개** 채널은 **지구본** |globe| 아이콘으로 식별됩니다. 팀의 누구나 공개 채널에 "
"참여할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:22
msgid "Public channels are identified with a Globe icon."
msgstr "공개 채널은 지구본 아이콘으로 식별됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Private** channels are typically used for sensitive topics, and are "
"identified with a **Lock** |lock| icon. You must be invited to private "
"channels by another channel member."
msgstr ""
"**비공개** 채널은 일반적으로 민감한 주제에 사용되며, **잠금** |lock| 아이콘으로 "
"식별됩니다. 비공개 채널에 참여하려면 다른 채널 구성원의 초대를 받아야 합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:25
msgid "Private channels are identified with a Lock icon."
msgstr "비공개 채널은 잠금 아이콘으로 식별됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:17
msgid ""
"To join a private channel, you need to be added to the channel by a "
"member of that channel."
msgstr ""
"비공개 채널에 참여하려면, 해당 채널의 구성원이 사용자를 채널에 추가해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:19
msgid "To join a public channel:"
msgstr "공개 채널에 참여하려면:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:23
msgid ""
"Select the **Add channels** button in the channel sidebar, then select "
"**Browse Channels**."
msgstr ""
"채널 사이드바에서 **채널 추가** 버튼을 선택한 다음 **채널 둘러보기**\\ 를 "
"선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:25
msgid "You can browse channels using the Add channels button"
msgstr "채널 추가 버튼을 사용하여 채널을 둘러볼 수 있습니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:29
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can select |plus| at the top of the channel sidebar, "
"then select **Browse Channels**."
msgstr ""
"또는 채널 사이드바 상단의 |plus|\\ 를 선택한 다음 **채널 둘러보기**\\ 를 선택할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:31
msgid "The Plus icon provides access to channel and direct message functionality."
msgstr "더하기 아이콘을 통해 채널 및 개인 메시지 기능에 액세스할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:31
msgid ""
"You can browse available channels to join using the + option at the top "
"of the channel sidebar."
msgstr ""
"채널 사이드바 상단의 + 옵션을 사용하여 참여할 수 있는 채널을 둘러볼 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:34
msgid "Select **Join** next to the public channel you want to join."
msgstr "참여하려는 공개 채널 옆의 **참여**\\ 를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:36
msgid ""
"When browsing available channels, select the join option next to any "
"channel to become a member."
msgstr ""
"사용 가능한 채널을 둘러볼 때, 채널의 구성원이 되려면 채널 옆의 참여 옵션을 "
"선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:41
msgid "Tap |plus| located in the top right corner the app."
msgstr "앱 오른쪽 상단 모서리에 있는 |plus|\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:43
msgid "Tap the plus icon to view additional options."
msgstr "추가 옵션을 보려면 더하기 아이콘을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:47
msgid "Tap **Browse Channels**."
msgstr "**채널 둘러보기**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:49
msgid "Click on Browse Channels to view the list of public channels."
msgstr "공개 채널 목록을 보려면 채널 둘러보기를 클릭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:53
msgid "Tap the public channel you want to join."
msgstr "참여하려는 공개 채널을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:55
msgid "Tap on the public channel name that you want to join."
msgstr "참여하려는 공개 채널 이름을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:61
msgid ""
"When you join channels, depending on the :doc:`channel actions configured"
" </end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels>`, you may see a welcome "
"message, and channels may be added to :doc:`a category in your channel "
"sidebar </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-channel-sidebar>` "
"automatically. Using Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app, "
"access **Channel Actions** from the channel name drop-down menu in the "
"center pane to see what automatic actions have been configured."
msgstr ""
"채널에 참여하면, :doc:`구성된 채널 작업 </end-user-guide/collaborate/create-"
"channels>`\\ 에 따라 환영 메시지가 표시될 수 있으며, 채널이 :doc:`채널 사이드바의 "
"카테고리 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-channel-sidebar>`\\ 에 "
"자동으로 추가될 수 있습니다. 웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용하여, "
"어떤 자동 작업이 구성되었는지 보려면 중앙 창의 채널 이름 드롭다운 메뉴에서 **채널 "
"작업**\\ 에 액세스하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:64
msgid "See the following documentation to learn more about working with channels:"
msgstr "채널 작업에 대해 자세히 알아보려면 다음 문서를 참조하세요:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:66
msgid ":doc:`Create channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels>`"
msgstr ":doc:`채널 만들기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels>`"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:67
msgid ":doc:`Browse channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/browse-channels>`"
msgstr ":doc:`채널 둘러보기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/browse-channels>`"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:68
msgid ""
":doc:`Customize your channel sidebar </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/customize-your-channel-sidebar>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 사이드바 사용자 지정 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-"
"channel-sidebar>`"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:71
msgid "Leave a channel"
msgstr "채널 나가기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:73
msgid ""
"When you leave a private channel, you must be re-added by another channel"
" member to rejoin. You won't receive mention notifications from a channel"
" if you're not a member of that channel."
msgstr ""
"비공개 채널을 나가면, 다시 참여하려면 다른 채널 구성원이 사용자를 다시 추가해야 "
"합니다. 채널의 구성원이 아니면 해당 채널에서 멘션 알림을 받지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:77
msgid ""
"All users are added to the **Town Square** channel automatically. This "
"means that users can't :ref:`archive <end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-"
"unarchive-channels:archive a channel>`, :ref:`unarchive <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels:unarchive a channel>`, or "
"leave the **Town Square** channel. However, :doc:`guests "
"</administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` who are manually invited "
"to **Town Square** can leave the channel."
msgstr ""
"모든 사용자는 자동으로 **Town Square** 채널에 추가됩니다. 즉, 사용자는 **Town "
"Square** 채널을 :ref:`보관 <end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-"
"channels:archive a channel>`, :ref:`보관 해제 <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/archive-unarchive-channels:unarchive a channel>`\\ 하거나 나갈 수 없습니다. "
"그러나 **Town Square**\\ 에 수동으로 초대된 :doc:`게스트 </administration-"
"guide/onboard/guest-accounts>`\\ 는 채널을 나갈 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:81
msgid ""
"Select the channel name at the top of the center pane to access the drop-"
"down menu, then select **Leave Channel**."
msgstr ""
"중앙 창 상단의 채널 이름을 선택하여 드롭다운 메뉴에 액세스한 다음 **채널 "
"나가기**\\ 를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:83
msgid ""
"You can use channel options available from the channel name to leave a "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"채널 이름에서 사용 가능한 채널 옵션을 사용하여 채널을 나갈 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:88
msgid "Tap the channel you want to leave."
msgstr "나가려는 채널을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:90
msgid "Select the channel that you want to leave."
msgstr "나가려는 채널을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:94
msgid ""
"Tap the **More** |more-icon-vertical| icon located in the top right "
"corner of the app."
msgstr ""
"앱 오른쪽 상단 모서리에 있는 **더 보기** |more-icon-vertical| 아이콘을 "
"탭하세요."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:50
msgid ""
"Use the More icon in the top left corner to access Mattermost desktop "
"apps customization settings."
msgstr ""
"왼쪽 상단 모서리의 더 보기 아이콘을 사용하여 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱 사용자 지정 "
"설정에 액세스하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:96
msgid ""
"Tap on More options to access available options for the channel you want "
"to leave."
msgstr ""
"나가려는 채널에 사용 가능한 옵션에 액세스하려면 더 보기 옵션을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:100
msgid "Tap **Leave channel**."
msgstr "**채널 나가기**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:102
msgid "Tap on Leave channel to leave the current channel."
msgstr "현재 채널을 나가려면 채널 나가기를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:106
msgid "Tap on **Leave** to confirm you choice."
msgstr "선택을 확인하려면 **나가기**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels.rst:108
msgid "Tap on Leave to confirm your choice."
msgstr "선택을 확인하려면 나가기를 탭하세요."

